      "lineIndex": 2,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਸੋਕੇ ॥੧੨॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) asoke ||12||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Griefless Lord! 12",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸੋਗੀ ਨਾ ਹੋ ਸਕਣ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੧੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं असोके ॥१२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74266",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0003",
      "lineIndex": 3,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਤਾਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) nirataape ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Woeless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸੰਤਾਪ-ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं नृतापे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74267",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0004",
      "lineIndex": 4,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਥਾਪੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) athaape ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Non-established Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਥਾਪਨਾ-ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अथापे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74268",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0005",
      "lineIndex": 5,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਤ੍ਰਿਮਾਨੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) tiramaane ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Universally-Honoured Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਤਿੰਨਾ ਕਾਲਾ (ਅਥਵਾ ਤਿੰਨਾ ਲੋਕਾ) ਵਿਚ ਮੰਨੇ ਜਾਣ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं तृमाने ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74269",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0006",
      "lineIndex": 6,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨਿਧਾਨੇ ॥੧੩॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) nidhaane ||13||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Treasure Lord! 13",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ (ਸਭ ਦੇ) ਭੰਡਾਰ ਸਰੂਪ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੧੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं निधाने ॥१३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74270",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0007",
      "lineIndex": 7,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਗਾਹੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) agaahe ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Bottomless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਨਾ ਪਕੜੇ ਜਾ ਸਕਣ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अगाहे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74271",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0008",
      "lineIndex": 8,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਬਾਹੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) abaahe ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Motionless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਨਾ ਚਲਾਏ ਜਾ ਸਕਣ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अबाहे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74272",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0009",
      "lineIndex": 9,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਤ੍ਰਿਬਰਗੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) tirabarage ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Virtue-full Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਤਿੰਨ ਵਰਗਾ (ਧਰਮ, ਅਰਥ ਅਤੇ ਕਾਮ) ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं तृबरगे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74273",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0010",
      "lineIndex": 10,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਸਰਗੇ ॥੧੪॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) asarage ||14||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Unborn Lord! 14",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਉਤਪੱਤੀ (ਸਰਗ) ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੧੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं असरगे ॥१४॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74274",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0011",
      "lineIndex": 11,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਪ੍ਰਭੋਗੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) prabhoge ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Enjoyer Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਉਤਮ ਫਲ (ਭੋਗ-ਸਾਮਗ੍ਰੀ) ਦੇਣ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं प्रभोगे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74275",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0012",
      "lineIndex": 12,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਸੁਜੋਗੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) sujoge ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Well-united Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸਾਰੀਆਂ ਯੋਗਤਾਵਾ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं सुजोगे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74276",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0013",
      "lineIndex": 13,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਰੰਗੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) ara(n)ge ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Colourless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਰੰਗ (ਵਰਣ) ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अरंगे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74277",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0014",
      "lineIndex": 14,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੰਗੇ ॥੧੫॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) abha(n)ge ||15||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Immortal Lord! 15",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਅਟੁੱਟ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੧੫॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अभंगे ॥१५॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74278",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0015",
      "lineIndex": 15,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਗੰਮੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) aga(n)me ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Unfathomable Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਪਹੁੰਚ ਤੋਂ ਪਰੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अगंमे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74279",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0016",
      "lineIndex": 16,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ ਰੰਮੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasatasat ra(n)me ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O All-Pervasive Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਸੁੰਦਰ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतसतु रंमे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74280",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0017",
      "lineIndex": 17,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਜਲਾਸਰੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) jalaasare ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Water-Sustainer Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਜਲ-ਆਸ਼ੇ (ਸਮੁੰਦਰ)! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं जलासरे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74281",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0018",
      "lineIndex": 18,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨਿਰਾਸਰੇ ॥੧੬॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) niraasare ||16||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Propless Lord! 16",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਬਿਨਾ ਆਸਰੇ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੧੬॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं निरासरे ॥१६॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74282",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0019",
      "lineIndex": 19,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਜਾਤੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) ajaate ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Casteless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਜਾਤੀ-ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अजाते ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74283",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0020",
      "lineIndex": 20,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਪਾਤੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) apaate ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Lineless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਗੋਤ-ਬਰਾਦਰੀ (ਪਾਤੀ) ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अपाते ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74284",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0021",
      "lineIndex": 21,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਮਜਬੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) amajabe ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Religionless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਮਜ਼੍ਹਬ ਤੋਂ ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अमजबे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74285",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0022",
      "lineIndex": 22,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤਸਤੁ ਅਜਬੇ ॥੧੭॥",
      "transliteration": "namasatasat ajabe ||17||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Wonderful Lord! 17",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਅਜਬ ਸਰੂਪ ਵਾਲੇ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੧੭॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतसतु अजबे ॥१७॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74286",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0023",
      "lineIndex": 23,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅਦੇਸੰ ਅਦੇਸੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "adhesa(n) adhese ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Homeless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਦੇਸ-ਰਹਿਤ (ਸਰਬ-ਵਿਆਪੀ)! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अदेसं अदेसे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74287",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0024",
      "lineIndex": 24,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਅਭੇਸੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) abhese ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Garbless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਭੇਸ ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं अभेसे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74288",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0025",
      "lineIndex": 25,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਧਾਮੇ ॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) niradhaame ||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Abodeless Lord!",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਧਾਮ (ਠਿਕਾਣਾ) ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ;",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 2,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नमसतं नृधामे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "74289",
      "sourceShabadId": "7403",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": "Dasam Granth"
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0002_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਮਸਤੰ ਨ੍ਰਿਬਾਮੇ ॥੧੮॥",
      "transliteration": "namasata(n) nirabaame ||18||",
      "translation": "Salutation to Thee O Spouseless Lord! 18",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਹੇ ਮਾਇਆ (ਬਾਮ) ਰਹਿਤ! ਤੈਨੂੰ ਨਮਸਕਾਰ ਹੈ ॥੧੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
